  "plan": "## Implementation Plan: Add code path to board\n\n### 1. Config Schema Changes\n\n#### Global Config (~/.mad/config.json)\n- Add `code_path` field (string, optional): Absolute path to project root\n- Add `context_file` field (string, optional): Relative or absolute path to CONTEXT.md file\n- Merge logic: Per-board config deep-merges with global config (global provides defaults, per-board overrides)\n\n#### Per-Board Config (~/.mad/boards/<boardname>/config.json)\n- Add `code_path` field (string, optional): Overrides global setting\n- Add `context_file` field (string, optional): Overrides global setting\n\n### 2. CONTEXT.md Location and Handling\n\n- **Location**: `<project_root>/.mad/CONTEXT.md` (where project_root is derived from board location or explicitly set via code_path)\n- **Resolution order**:\n  1. If `context_file` is an absolute path, use it directly\n  2. If `context_file` is relative, resolve relative to `code_path`\n  3. Default: `<project_root>/.mad/CONTEXT.md`\n- **Size handling**: Maximum file size of 100KB. If larger, truncate with message at the end: \"[CONTEXT TRUNCATED - file exceeded 100KB limit]\"\n- **Symlink handling**: Resolve symlinks to real paths using `os.path.realpath()` before storing or using `code_path`\n\n### 3. Agent Invocation Changes\n\n- **Working directory**: When invoking an agent, set `cwd` to `code_path` (resolved real path)\n- **Instruction prepending**: For each new agent session (not every turn), prepend the following to the agent's system instructions:\n  ```\n  Code Path: <resolved_code_path>\n  Context File: <path_to_context.md>\n  \n  ```\n- **Initial load only**: Context is added once at session start, not on every message/turn\n\n### 4. Implementation Steps\n\n1. **Update config schema**: Modify config loading to support new fields with deep merge for per-board configs\n2. **Add path resolution utilities**:\n   - `resolve_code_path(board_path)` - derives project root from board location or uses explicit code_path\n   - `resolve_context_file(code_path, context_file)` - resolves context file path with fallback to default\n   - `read_context_file(path)` - reads with size limit and truncation\n3. **Modify agent invoker**:\n   - Update `invoke_agent()` to accept and use `code_path` for cwd\n   - Update instruction generation to prepend code path and context file path\n4. **Add CLI commands**:\n   - `mad config set-code-path <path>` - Set code_path in global or board config\n   - `mad config set-context-file <path>` - Set context_file path\n   - `mad context edit` - Open CONTEXT.md in editor (creates if not exists)\n\n### 5. Security Considerations\n\n- Document that setting working directory is controlled by the user's board configuration\n- Agent working directory matches what the user has configured for their project\n- No additional sandboxing added (existing process isolation applies)\n\n### 6. Backward Compatibility\n\n- All new fields are optional\n- Existing boards continue to work without changes\n- If code_path not set, derive from board location (current behavior)"
